{"v":4,"catch":"Classic Solitaire 是一款流行的單人紙牌棋盤遊戲，您必須在其中按特定順序排列整個牌組。","desc":"Solitaire: Classic Card Game 是在 Nintendo Switch 上進行冥想遊戲的完美選擇，無論是手持模式還是電視模式。\n\n紙牌的規則很簡單——你需要揭開所有隱藏的牌，並按從國王到王牌的順序收集一堆相同的花色，以便將牌從桌子上移走。 只要場地是空的，遊戲就結束了。\n\n遊戲特色：\n• 三個不同花色的難度級別；\n• 通過 Joy-Con™️ 控制器或觸摸屏進行控制；\n• 冥想遊戲；\n• 令人愉悅的簡約圖形；","publisher":"Megame","release":"2022-10-27","genres":["桌上遊戲","街機","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5209565b6a474efecd0ee374155052909dfbe3fd9de230e47c220886168f1a15.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dc794c0470ec9055b2dad4ad5a80875d82e67c1a0bfb0a9dbda59c44baaa80de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f97ef055786eb9fc0bfbad720891a3e1b811f499c1e974b8f30042129d7ce092.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/35aeaeb6edcbc788c665ee2a872250bca35de91f49aad5720b9a478c821f5b06.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5baa2318a9791a7987ef537a9f280f9734d2ce7ae5d09fbdbd56e010d2b1a892.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/76181581b465c4bc411f98a18a6277fb924289f0b28004e843b818ef2c8a1c4a.jpg"],"titleId":"01001ab01945e000","dlc":[]}